issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Description\r\n\r\nCommit 99e2395c0286d044865a6f372c1296e6e5e042f1 ([#9936] Remove all direct YBClient usage from PgSession) changes BackfillIndex RPC from\r\n\r\n    postgres -> master\r\n\r\nto\r\n\r\n    postgres -> tserver -> master\r\n\r\nThe former call shifts to `tserver -> master`, and `postgres -> tserver` RPC is introduced.  However, this RPC uses the default admin timeout `yb_client_admin_operation_timeout_sec` rather than the backfill-specific timeout `backfill_index_client_rpc_timeout_ms`.  Usually, `backfill_index_client_rpc_timeout_ms` is set higher than `yb_client_admin_operation_timeout_sec`, so the consequence is that the `postgres -> tserver` connection using `yb_client_admin_operation_timeout_sec` times out sooner than expected.\r\n\r\nEven if the user doesn't set these flags, the defaults run into the issue: `yb_client_admin_operation_timeout_sec` is default 2m while `backfill_index_client_rpc_timeout_ms` is default 60m.\r\n\r\nSolution seems to be to avoid listing `BackfillIndex` in boost macros, particularly `YB_PG_CLIENT_SIMPLE_METHOD_IMPL` which eventually does\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n      controller->set_timeout(FLAGS_yb_client_admin_operation_timeout_sec * 1s);\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe function can be separately defined to use `FLAGS_backfill_index_client_rpc_timeout_ms` instead.","closed_by":{"login":"jasonyb","id":93959687,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZm2Bw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93959687?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb","html_url":"https://github.com/jasonyb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/10646/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/10646/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}